    "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the adult female performer from <Picture 1>, with long platinum-blonde hair streaked with bright pink and violet, dramatic makeup, a black leather jacket, black outfit, and oversized white sneakers.\n<Subject 2> is the rooftop parking-deck setting from <Picture 1>, with concrete surfaces, painted parking lines, distant low-rise buildings, open sky, and direct sun.\n<Audio 1> is the supplied female rap-song audio track, reused as the complete synchronized soundtrack; <Subject 1> lip-syncs precisely to its vocal performance.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation + audio reuse] A 17-second, high-energy rooftop rap-performance video featuring <Subject 1> in <Subject 2>. The video uses multiple sharp camera-angle changes, forceful performance gestures, confident expressions, and exact lip-sync to <Audio 1>.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4], [Shot 5]): fully_preserved - preserve her adult identity, platinum hair with pink and violet streaks, black leather styling, and white sneakers.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4], [Shot 5]): fully_preserved - retain the exposed rooftop parking-deck environment and bright daylight.\n<Audio 1>: fully_copy - reuse <Audio 1> 1:1 as the complete final synchronized audio track, with no added audio layers.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is a bold, polished urban rap-performance film. Strong daylight, hard-edged shadows, crisp contrast, and fast editorial rhythm create a commanding music-video look. <Audio 1> is the only audio: <Subject 1> maintains exact, continuous lip-sync to the supplied female rap vocal through every shot. \n\n[Shot 1] A low-angle medium-wide shot begins with <Subject 1> crouched on the concrete ledge in the pose established by <Picture 1>, surrounded by <Subject 2>. On the opening beat, she snaps her gaze directly into the lens, rises sharply to a standing position, and throws one hand forward in a powerful stop gesture while lip-syncing precisely to <Audio 1>. The camera pushes in with large amplitude at fast speed, creating an assertive entrance. Her striped hair whips backward in the wind; she locks into a fearless, challenging expression.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.400, the camera cuts to a tight low-angle close-up. <Subject 1> steps toward the lens, points directly at it, then pulls her hand back to her chest in time with the rap cadence. The camera trucks left with large amplitude at fast speed while she turns her head sharply, lips matching every syllable of <Audio 1>. Her eyes narrow, then she flashes a confident half-smile.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:06.800, the shot cuts to a dynamic full-body side view. <Subject 1> strides along the rooftop line with decisive, rhythmic steps, swings her jacket open, and punches both arms downward on the strongest beats. The camera performs a fast tracking shot beside her, then pans right to keep her centered. Her hair streams behind her as she delivers fierce lip-sync and a defiant stare.\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:10.300, the camera cuts to an extreme close-up from slightly below eye level. <Subject 1> leans into frame with an intense expression, sharply lifts her chin, and traces two fingers across the lens plane without touching it. The camera zooms out with small amplitude at fast speed as she pivots her shoulders and gives a powerful hair toss, maintaining accurate lip-sync to <Audio 1>.\n\n[Shot 5] At 00:13.800, the shot cuts to a wide hero angle. <Subject 1> plants her feet wide at the rooftop edge, crosses her arms, then uncrosses them in one explosive outward gesture. The camera makes a fast arc shot around her, ending in a low-angle medium close-up. She fixes the camera with a final fierce expression, lip-syncing through the last beat as her hair settles in the wind.\n\noverall_soundscape:\n<Audio 1> is the only audible track. No additional ambience, sound effects, dialogue, or vocal layers.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/